**Issue:** Non-reentrant Lock acquired twice by the same thread.
**Why:** The second acquire blocks forever because only one thread can hold it - self-deadlock.
**Fix:**
class Safe:
    def __init__(self):
        self.lock = threading.RLock()  # reentrant lock allows nested acquire

